{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"苏轼·controversies-and-appraisal","stage":"DONE","category":"su-shi","categoryLabel":"苏轼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/26_su-shi/6_controversies-and-appraisal","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"苏轼-争议与评价\">苏轼·争议与评价</h1><p>本 hub 处理一个不同于其他苏轼分支的任务：不是&quot;介绍苏轼有多伟大&quot;，而是&quot;如何严谨地评价苏轼&quot;——正视围绕其政治生涯与思想的真实争议，再以据实加权的方法得出公允判断。这里关心的是证据、争议与方法，而非赞美。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 讲&quot;发生了什么&quot;（含乌台诗案、三次贬谪的史实）；本 hub 讲&quot;该如何评价这些遭遇&quot;。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>、<a href=\"../major-works/\">作品</a> 正面展开苏轼在词、文、书、画的成就；本 hub 不重复展开，只在评价&quot;博而不专&quot;质疑时引用其结论。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a> 阐释其旷达境界与三教融通的内涵；本 hub 借此辨析&quot;旷达是否逃避&quot;。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 讲身后的接受史与当代价值；本 hub 是其评价学的&quot;上游&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：其他 hub 回答&quot;是什么&quot;，本 hub 回答&quot;怎么评、争议是否成立&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构与推荐学习路径\">三章结构与推荐学习路径</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>政治与党争</strong>（事件层）——<a href=\"politics-and-faction/between-the-factions\">党争中的苏轼</a> 给出三十年党争年表与&quot;两面不讨好&quot;的代价；<a href=\"politics-and-faction/the-statesman-assessed\">政治家的评价</a> 用政绩清单核算其得失。</li>\n<li><strong>两大争议</strong>（辨析层）——<a href=\"debates/genius-or-dilettante\">全才与博而不专之议</a> 用专家榜单检验&quot;广度真伪&quot;；<a href=\"debates/the-question-of-depth\">旷达与逃避之辨</a> 用《寒食帖》检验&quot;深度真伪&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>综合评价</strong>（收束层）——<a href=\"overall-appraisal/the-complete-man\">完整的人</a> 把多维统一为一个人格判断；<a href=\"overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment\">全面的评判</a> 给出&quot;资产负债表&quot;式的评价方法论。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>推荐按&quot;第一章 → 第二章 → 第三章&quot;顺序阅读：先掌握事实与代价，再辨析争议，最后综合评判。</p>\n<p><strong>前置建议</strong>：先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/a-career-of-exile/the-wutai-poetry-case\">生平·乌台诗案</a> 了解关键史实，再进入本 hub 的评价，会更顺畅。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"politics-and-faction","title":"Politics And Faction","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/politics-and-faction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"between-the-factions","title":"党争中的苏轼","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/politics-and-faction/between-the-factions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-statesman-assessed","title":"政治家的评价","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/politics-and-faction/the-statesman-assessed"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"Debates","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"genius-or-dilettante","title":"全才与博而不专之议","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/genius-or-dilettante"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-question-of-depth","title":"旷达与逃避之辨","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/the-question-of-depth"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-complete-man","title":"完整的人","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-complete-man"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment"}]}]}